/* Classic theme for the guild war / battle soccer score (CBattleSoccerScore). The 0.97 client's
   (004bc220): no frame, at the top of the area the open windows leave free, its x 20
   left of that area's centre (the classic workspace centres the 640 frame on it, so x 300): two
   rows at y 4 and 19, each the guild mark (8 x 8) at 0, the score at 13 and the name at 30, bold on
   a black 50% box, red (255, 60, 0) or blue (0, 150, 255). Legacy's rules first, then the classic
   ones. */

/* Legacy theme for CBattleSoccerScore, reproducing the original's RenderBackImage()/
   RenderContents(): the 131 x 70 figure-ground back, then two lines from (x + 30, y + 33), 22 apart:
   the score, the guild mark at + 21 (8 x 8) and the name at + 33, in the bold font on a 50% black
   text box (SetBgColor(0, 0, 0, 128)), red (255, 60, 0) or blue (0, 150, 255). Reference px relative
   to the window's top-left, under .screen's W/640 x H/480 stretch (see battle_soccer_score.rml). */

@spritesheet bss-back-sheet { src: "../../../newui_Figure_ground.tga"; bss-back: 0px 0px 131px 70px; }

body { pointer-events: none; }

.screen {
	position: absolute;
	left: 0;
	top: 0;
	width: 640px;
	height: 480px;
	transform-origin: left top;
	pointer-events: none;
}

#panel { position: absolute; width: 131px; height: 70px; font-family: "token(font-body)"; }
#back { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 131px; height: 70px; decorator: image(bss-back); }

.team { display: block; position: absolute; left: 30px; width: 100px; height: 8px; }
.team-text {
	display: block;
	position: absolute;
	top: 0;
	transform-origin: left top;
	white-space: nowrap;
	font-weight: bold;
	color: #0096ff;
	background-color: #00000080;
}
.team.red .team-text { color: #ff3c00; }
.team-score { left: 0; }
.team-name { left: 33px; }

.mark { position: absolute; left: 21px; top: 0; width: 8px; height: 8px; }
.mark-cell { display: block; float: left; width: 1px; height: 1px; }

/* RenderContents()'s own two rows. The container takes no space. */
.teams { position: static; }
.team:nth-child(1) { top: 33px; }
.team:nth-child(2) { top: 55px; }

/* The HUD takes no pointer events where it is placed (base.rcss gives a placed panel them). */
#panel.slot-placed { pointer-events: none; }

/* --- Classic ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
#back { display: none; }
.team { left: 0; }
.team:nth-child(1) { top: 4px; }
.team:nth-child(2) { top: 19px; }
.mark { left: 0; }
.team-score { left: 13px; }
.team-name { left: 30px; }
